      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA KELSEY (1) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (25.86) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Q Lakeside. Meets a moderate line up and rates on top this time. BIONIC BELLA (8) turned in a plain effort last time when fifth at Q Lakeside over 457m behind Blue Magician (25.78) in a Grade 5. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Key player if finds best. SOMEONE'S IDEA (4) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a one length second (20.02) in a Grade 3/4 at Capalaba. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. PAW GAMMA (5) was below best last time at this track (30.60) in a Grade 5, finishing a 8 length seventh. Already a winner from this draw.",
